		<item>
		<title>楊子清老師音樂短講第5集：聲區與轉變點 Registers &#038; Passaggio</title>
		<link>https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2020/09/11/%e6%a5%8a%e5%ad%90%e6%b8%85%e8%80%81%e5%b8%ab%e9%9f%b3%e6%a8%82%e7%9f%ad%e8%ac%9b%e7%ac%ac5%e9%9b%86%ef%bc%9a%e8%81%b2%e5%8d%80%e8%88%87%e8%bd%89%e8%ae%8a%e9%bb%9e-registers-passaggio/</link>
					<comments>https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2020/09/11/%e6%a5%8a%e5%ad%90%e6%b8%85%e8%80%81%e5%b8%ab%e9%9f%b3%e6%a8%82%e7%9f%ad%e8%ac%9b%e7%ac%ac5%e9%9b%86%ef%bc%9a%e8%81%b2%e5%8d%80%e8%88%87%e8%bd%89%e8%ae%8a%e9%bb%9e-registers-passaggio/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2020 00:41:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[楊子清 Cliff Yang 音樂教室]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[聲區與轉變點]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[楊子清老師音樂短講第5集]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Registers & Passaggio]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.taiwanjustice.net/?p=223591</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>楊子清老師以YouTube 上由英國皇家歌劇院 Royal Opera 的指揮 Antonio Pappano 和皇家音樂院 Royal Academy of Music 的教授合作解釋聲區與轉變點 Registers (胸聲，中聲，頭聲）與 Passaggio (過渡音，橋樑，轉變點）的影片為例幫助大家瞭解轉變點的重要。 本集所引用的影片都是由下列的連結影片中摘錄出來的： Cecilia Bartoli The Greatest Coloratura Mezzo Soprano (Soprano for some) of all times https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6m1T1&#8230; THE “PASSAGGIO”-JONAS KAUFMANN AND ANTONIO PAPPANO https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=03cEa&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.taiwanjustice.net/2020/09/11/%e6%a5%8a%e5%ad%90%e6%b8%85%e8%80%81%e5%b8%ab%e9%9f%b3%e6%a8%82%e7%9f%ad%e8%ac%9b%e7%ac%ac5%e9%9b%86%ef%bc%9a%e8%81%b2%e5%8d%80%e8%88%87%e8%bd%89%e8%ae%8a%e9%bb%9e-registers-passaggio/" target="_blank">楊子清老師音樂短講第5集：聲區與轉變點 Registers & Passaggio</a> first appeared on <a href="https://www.taiwanjustice.net/" target="_blank">Taiwan Justice | 台灣公義報</a>.</p>]]></description>
		
